WEBVTT

00:08:29.129 --> 00:08:30.629
It was a powerful mission.

00:08:30.653 --> 00:08:34.025
And I think as a workforce and as a team,

00:08:34.049 --> 00:08:35.732
people got really excited about it,

00:08:35.756 --> 00:08:37.322
and it motivated them

00:08:37.346 --> 00:08:40.117
and the closer proximity
you had to the customers

00:08:40.141 --> 00:08:42.965
and the more you can see
that you are affecting these people

00:08:42.989 --> 00:08:44.877
and helping them day in and day out,

00:08:44.901 --> 00:08:46.927
whether they were the owner of the company

00:08:46.951 --> 00:08:48.765
or an employee of the company,

00:08:48.789 --> 00:08:51.926
people were really
charged up to help them.

00:08:52.407 --> 00:08:54.903
AG: Is there a story, Dave,
that illustrates a moment

00:08:54.927 --> 00:08:57.906
when you really felt
fired up by the mission,

00:08:57.930 --> 00:08:59.919
wondering was there a company retreat

00:08:59.943 --> 00:09:02.133
where a speech resonated with you,